# KSV-0047: apps/core/alloy/rbac.yaml grants nodes/proxy get to the Alloy ServiceAccount.
# Required to scrape kubelet/cadvisor metrics via /api/v1/nodes/{name}/proxy/metrics —
# same permission kube-prometheus-stack's own kubelet-scrape ClusterRole needs. Scoped to
# one verb (get) on one resource, bound to one ServiceAccount in one namespace — not a
# blanket exception.
KSV-0047

# KSV-0109: apps/core/argocd/argocd-cm.yaml's oidc.config has a `clientSecret`
# key — Trivy flags the key NAME regardless of value. The value is
# `$zitadel-argocd-oidc-secret:clientSecret`, ArgoCD's own indirection syntax
# for resolving the real secret from the Terraform-managed Secret at runtime —
# no secret material is actually in this ConfigMap.
KSV-0109
